OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting under reported says
OL,4,Apolice commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say shoplifting is still an
OL,7,Funder reported offence, despite an
OL,8,Fincrease in recent years.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall police and crime
OL,11,Fcommissioner (PCC) Alison Hernandez
OL,12,Fsaid the force had the lowest crime
OL,13,Frate of shoplifting in the country for
OL,14,Fyears because of a significant under
OL,15,Freporting of incidents.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
