OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting under reported says
OL,4,Apolice commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Antony Hart said despite a
OL,7,F"really big uptick in the volume of
OL,8,Freports over the last five years or so"
OL,9,Fthe crime is often not reported and
OL,10,Fsome pubs and restaurants may choose to
OL,11,Fmake an appeal on social media instead
OL,12,F- a course of action the police advises
OL,13,Fagainst.
OL,15,FHe added: "It's really important
OL,16,Fbecause... if we don't know about them
OL,17,Fwe're unable to investigate them."
